## Scope

This repository is dual-licensed. The MIT License above covers the **machinery**
— the files that make this an LLM wiki rather than a folder of notes:

  - CLAUDE.md
  - settings/schema.md
  - settings/categories.md
  - README.md

Copy them, adapt them, build your own wiki on them. That is what they are for.

The **wiki content** — everything under wiki/, plus 1.Index.md, 2.Syntheses.md,
3.Articles.md and 4.History.md — is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International instead. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

